Note on the underlying figures: the energy, carbon, and water estimates come
from third-party sources cited in the methodology section of index.html
(EcoLogits, Ember, Our World in Data, EPA, and the academic papers listed
there). Those are facts and estimates used as data, which copyright does not
restrict, but the sources are credited on the page.
